        "id": "action_step_4",
        "instruction": {
          "title": "Add a 4th Domain \u2192 Tetrahedral (109.5\u00b0)",
          "description": "With four domains, the minimum-repulsion arrangement is tetrahedral, giving an ideal electron-domain angle of 109.5\u00b0."
