      {
        "id": "action_step_5",
        "instruction": {
          "title": "Electron-Domain vs Molecular Geometry (Lone Pairs)",
          "description": "Lone pairs count as electron domains (they affect arrangement), but they are not part of the molecular shape traced by bonded atoms. Compare idealized domain geometry to the molecular geometry that results when one or more domains is a lone pair."
        },
